cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Africa Oracle Extraction Agent"
abstract: >
  Resilient mobile-money price oracle for African currencies. Aggregates real-time
  FX feeds from M-Pesa, Airtel Money, Orange Money, and MTN MoMo across ~30 countries
  into a quorum-protected, outlier-filtered median rate. Phase 0 of the AFRI Jetton
  stablecoin on TON (TIP-74).
